OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FOn the hottest day of the year so
OL,7,     Ffar, paramedics blue-light in a
OL,8,     Fman who is vomiting blood, and an
OL,9,     Finfant is rushed in after coffee
OL,10,     Faccidentally scalded his head.
OL,11,     F(S9, E13)
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FFour top dermatologists treat
OL,14,     Fpatients for skin conditions such
OL,15,     Fas cysts, lipomas and skin tags
OL,16,     Fthat the NHS views as cosmetic,
OL,17,     Fbut that can hugely affect the
OL,18,     Fsufferers.
OL,19,G0335 Home and Away
OL,20,     FAlf refuses to budge. Dana makes a
OL,21,     Fbig decision. Tane confronts
OL,22,     FSonny.
